  "description": {
   "en": "Chanbit Han: award winning actor, trendsetter, and all-around nice guy…at least on the surface. As his manager and best friend, Baekyung knows the real Chanbit. Sure, he’s kind and gentle but, in the bedroom, he’s anything but. When Chanbit was starting his career, he fell in love with Youngha Do, entrepreneur and Chanbit’s guide into the depths of BDSM. Now Youngha’s back and is the CEO of Chanbit’s entertainment agency. Torn between Youngha and Baekyung, will he follow his heart or his career?",
   "es": "Chanbit Han un galardonado actor, pionero de la moda y un buen tipo … al menos en la superficie. Como su manager y mejor amigo, Baekyung conoce el verdadero Chanbit. Claro, él es amable y gentil, pero, en el dormitorio, no es nada de eso. Cuando Chanbit comenzaba su carrera, se enamoró de Youngha Do, emprendedor y la guía de Chanbit en las profundidades de BDSM. Ahora Youngha ha vuelto y es el CEO de la agencia de entretenimiento Chanbit. Interrumpido entre Youngha y Baekyung, ¿seguirá su corazón o su carrera?"
  },
